  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Replaced SetStatusAsync with explicit job lifecycle transitions.\n            - Added StartedAt and FinishedAt timestamps to JobInfo.\n            - Updated job execution flow to use Pending → Running → Completed/Failed transitions.\n            - Added job lifecycle tracking and duration support.\n            - Improved UTC job monitoring UI with status-specific time display.\n            - Refactored job tests to validate real execution paths instead of arbitrary status changes.\n            - Added coverage for StartedAt and FinishedAt behavior.\n            - Simplified Store API by aligning CompleteAsync and FailAsync result handling.\n            - Improved queue execution and job monitoring infrastructure.\n            - General cleanup, refactoring, and test coverage improvements.",
